This package ports the semantics of numpy.random in NumPy 2.5.4:
SeedSequence (bit_generator.pyx), PCG64 with the XSL-RR output, the MT19937
of RandomState with its init_genrand seeding, the draws random_interval,
random_bounded_uint64 and buffered_bounded_lemire_uint32 of distributions.c,
and the shuffle, permutation, choice, randint and random_sample of
_generator.pyx and mtrand.pyx. The package does not include NumPy's code.

